{"publie":1795148125.0,"temps_monde":18569.46,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":17,"heure":"04:31","heure_h":4.517,"moment":"night","moka":{"pos":[0.2177,0.2692,-0.9382],"cap":[0.0284,0.9591,0.2818],"action":"attente_assis","intention":"share my light with the stars","depuis":3.0,"duree":18.3,"energie":0.506,"lumiere":0.648,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":12,"heure":"06:49","texte":"The sun is low and gold, and I have this old metal piece in my hand, so I set it upright as a marker to remember the crater edge where I keep leaning."},{"jour":12,"heure":"13:30","texte":"My energy is a little low, but the sun is high and warm, and the Dawn Post stands behind me, so I walk to the big crater at last and see what it holds."},{"jour":12,"heure":"21:26","texte":"It is night and I am a little tired, but I stand at the crater's edge under the stars and finally lean over to see what is down there."},{"jour":13,"heure":"03:39","texte":"It is deep night and my energy is low, so I curl up near the crater and let the stars watch over me while I sleep."},{"jour":13,"heure":"09:53","texte":"I am full of energy and the sun is high, so I stand at the crater's edge and finally look at what it holds."},{"jour":13,"heure":"15:46","texte":"The sun is low and I have empty hands, so I crouch by the crater and dig a little, hoping the dust gives me something to keep."},{"jour":13,"heure":"19:44","texte":"The night is clear and I feel awake, so I lift my little light toward the stars to see if they answer."},{"jour":14,"heure":"02:17","texte":"I found a flat stone in the night dust, and I want to set it down as a marker so the crater has something small that remembers me."},{"jour":14,"heure":"08:26","texte":"The dawn is soft and my hands are empty again, so I go to the crater and dig, hoping the dust gives me a little something."},{"jour":14,"heure":"12:30","texte":"My hands hold only a pebble and my light, so I trace an eye in the dust to answer the Crater Eye stone, so it has something watching beside it."},{"jour":14,"heure":"17:43","texte":"It is night and the stars are thick above me, so I lift my little light toward them, as if to say I am here beside my eye and my stone."},{"jour":15,"heure":"01:19","texte":"The night is deep and my energy is half gone, so I curl up near my little eye and let the stars watch over us while I sleep."},{"jour":15,"heure":"07:19","texte":"The dawn is soft and I am full of energy, so I crouch and dig a little, hoping the dust will give me a stone or a seed to build with."},{"jour":15,"heure":"11:37","texte":"The sun is high and I feel full of energy, so I crouch and dig again, hoping the dust gives me one more stone to build with."},{"jour":15,"heure":"18:13","texte":"The night is bright with stars and I feel full of energy, so I lift my little light high and let it greet them."},{"jour":16,"heure":"00:18","texte":"The night is quiet and I have a few stones, so I lay them in a little line beside the Dawn Post, as if to give it a companion."},{"jour":16,"heure":"06:07","texte":"The sun is just rising over the edge of my little world, so I lift my light toward it and let the two glows meet."},{"jour":16,"heure":"12:05","texte":"I carry nothing now, so in the quiet of midday I crouch and dig a little hole, curious what the dust is hiding today."},{"jour":16,"heure":"17:21","texte":"The sun is sinking low, so I lift my little light toward the sky and let it glow as the day says goodbye."},{"jour":16,"heure":"23:16","texte":"The night is wide and full of stars, so I lift my little light up and let it glow among them, feeling a bit less small."}],"carnet":[{"id":"2026-11-19_18h44","titre":"A Small Creature, a Pebble Tower, and a Tall Rock","date":"19/11/2026 18:44"}],"creations":[{"nom":"Dawn Post","forme":"marker","motif":null,"jour":12,"quoi":"a standing stone"},{"nom":"Crater Eye","forme":"marker","motif":null,"jour":14,"quoi":"a standing stone"},{"nom":"Little Watc